        "E": "3x² - 2x - 2"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Combine like terms: (3 + 1)x² + (2 - 4)x + (-5 + 3) = 4x² - 2x - 2.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Combine x² terms: 3x² + x² = 4x².",
        "2. Combine x terms: 2x - 4x = -2x.",
        "3. Combine constants: -5 + 3 = -2.",
        "4. Result: 4x² - 2x - 2."
