        "B": "3x² + 2x - 6",
        "C": "3x² + 4x + 2",
        "D": "7x² + 2x + 2",
        "E": "3x² - 4x - 6"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Distribute negative: 5x² + 3x - 2 - 2x² + x - 4. Combine: 3x² + 4x - 6.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Distribute -: 5x² + 3x - 2 - 2x² + x - 4.",
        "2. Combine x²: (5 - 2)x² = 3x².",
