        "E": "3x³ + 2x² + 5x"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Distribute x: x(3x²) + x(-2x) + x(5) = 3x³ - 2x² + 5x.",
      "steps": [
        "1. Distribute x to each term.",
        "2. x × 3x² = 3x³.",
        "3. x × (-2x) = -2x².",
